# Gson-mapped master data model and its lenient adapter (release/R8).
-keep class com.lambrk.qrcode.domain.model.MasterRecord { *; }
-keep class com.lambrk.qrcode.domain.model.LenientIntAdapter { <init>(); }
-keepattributes Signature, *Annotation*
